msgid "This page is used by Events Made Easy. Don't change it, don't use it in your menu's, don't delete it. Just make sure the EME setting called 'Events page' points to this page. EME uses this page to render any and all events, locations, bookings, maps, ... anything. If you do want to delete this page, create a new one EME can use and update the EME setting 'Events page' accordingly."
